eer"},{"text":"Production Manager"},{"text":"Process Manager"},{"text":"Quality Manager"},{"text":"Plant Operations Manager"},{"text":"Technical Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What employers may test"},{"type":"h","text":"Ceramic fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect questions about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sintering"},{"text":"Porosity"},{"text":"Grain growth"},{"text":"Densification"},{"text":"Refractory materials"},{"text":"Thermal shock"},{"text":"Ceramic brittleness"},{"text":"Phase transformations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Production"},{"type":"p","text":"They may ask:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Why do ceramic products crack during drying?"},{"text":"Why does warpage occur during firing?"},{"text":"How does particle size affect sintering?"},{"text":"What causes porosity?"},{"text":"How would you optimize kiln temperature?"},{"text":"How would you reduce rejection?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Be prepared for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SPC"},{"text":"Cp/Cpk"},{"text":"Pareto"},{"text":"Fishbone"},{"text":"5 Why"},{"text":"OEE"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Production problem-solving framework"},{"type":"p","text":"Suppose production defects suddenly increase."},{"type":"p","text":"A good Production Engineer should investigate:"}]},{"heading":"Verification","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This systematic approach is more valuable than simply adjusting process parameters by trial and error."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An M.Tech is not mandatory for production-oriented ceramic engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"Industrial experience can be more important for plant/production roles."},{"type":"p","text":"However, postgraduate study is valuable for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced ceramics"},{"text":"Refractories"},{"text":"Electronic ceramics"},{"text":"Ceramic composites"},{"text":"Materials R&D"},{"text":"Energy materials"},{"